    "A film picked from Emby by somebody granted it is relayed to everybody in the room." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A film picked from Emby by somebody granted it is relayed to everybody in the room."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許可された人が Emby から選んだ作品は、部屋の全員に中継されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已授权的人从 Emby 选的片会中转给房间里的每个人。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已授權的人從 Emby 選的片會中轉給房間裡的每個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A later rule overrides an earlier one for the same feature, so a narrower rule further down can turn a feature back on. With no platform ticked, a rule is for every platform." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A later rule overrides an earlier one for the same feature, so a narrower rule further down can turn a feature back on. With no platform ticked, a rule is for every platform."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じ機能に複数のルールがあるときは後のものが優先されるので、下に範囲の狭いルールを置けば機能をもう一度オンにできます。プラットフォームを一つも選ばなければ、すべてのプラットフォームが対象です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一个功能有多条规则时，后面的覆盖前面的，所以可以在下面加一条范围更窄的规则把功能重新打开。一个平台都不勾，就是对所有平台生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一個功能有多條規則時，後面的覆蓋前面的，所以可以在下面加一條範圍更窄的規則把功能重新打開。一個平台都不勾，就是對所有平台生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link lets somebody outside your scope into one of its rooms as a guest. Leave the end empty for a link that works until it is stopped." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A link lets somebody outside your scope into one of its rooms as a guest. Leave the end empty for a link that works until it is stopped."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リンクを使うと、グループ外の人がグループの部屋にゲストとして入れます。終了を空けておくと、無効にするまで使えるリンクになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "链接能让组外的人以访客身份进入组里的某个房间。失效时间留空,链接就一直有效,直到有人让它失效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連結能讓群組外的人以訪客身分進入群組裡的某個房間。失效時間留空,連結就一直有效,直到有人讓它失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
