    "A passphrase is never stored, so nobody can be shown one later — not even you. What you can do is set a new one and pass it on. People sign in at /account to change it themselves and to choose a picture." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A passphrase is never stored, so nobody can be shown one later — not even you. What you can do is set a new one and pass it on. People sign in at /account to change it themselves and to choose a picture."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パスフレーズは保存されないため、後から誰にも表示できません。あなたにもです。できるのは新しいものを設定して渡すことだけです。本人は /account でログインしてパスフレーズや画像を変更できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "口令从不保存,所以事后谁也看不到——包括你自己。你能做的是重设一个再交给对方。用户在 /account 登录后可以自己改口令、换头像。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通行語從不保存,所以事後誰也看不到——包括你自己。你能做的是重設一個再交給對方。使用者在 /account 登入後可以自己改通行語、換頭像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A point is the mean over its own bucket and the band behind the line is the highest single reading inside it, which is where a burst shows. Totals are since this process started. The trend outlives a restart: fine detail recently, coarser the further back it goes, out to six months." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A point is the mean over its own bucket and the band behind the line is the highest single reading inside it, which is where a burst shows. Totals are since this process started. The trend outlives a restart: fine detail recently, coarser the further back it goes, out to six months."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各点はそのバケット内の平均で、線の背後の帯はバケット内の単一の読み取りの最大値です。バーストはそこに現れます。累計はこのプロセスの起動以降です。トレンドは再起動後も残ります。直近は細かく、さかのぼるほど粗くなり、最長で6か月です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个点是它那一格内的平均值,线条后面的色带是格内单次读数的最高值,突发流量就出现在那里。累计量从本进程启动算起。趋势会在重启后留存:近期精细,越往前越粗,最长六个月。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個點是它那一格內的平均值,線條後面的色帶是格內單次讀數的最高值,突發流量就出現在那裡。累計量從本行程啟動算起。趨勢會在重啟後留存:近期精細,越往前越粗,最長六個月。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A relay by that name is already here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
