    "The configuration file relays every video (meet.watch.direct_only is off), so these switches change nothing until that is turned on. Emby films still need the grant." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The configuration file relays every video (meet.watch.direct_only is off), so these switches change nothing until that is turned on. Emby films still need the grant."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルがすべての動画を中継する設定です(meet.watch.direct_only がオフ)。それをオンにするまで、どのスイッチも何も変えません。Emby の作品には引き続き個別の許可が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置文件设为中转所有视频(meet.watch.direct_only 是关的),在打开它之前,这些开关都不起作用。Emby 片仍然需要单独开通。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定檔設為中轉所有影片(meet.watch.direct_only 是關的),在打開它之前,這些開關都不起作用。Emby 片仍然需要單獨開通。"
          }
        }
      }
