    "These were changed elsewhere since you began. Saving replaces that change with this list; discarding shows it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These were changed elsewhere since you began. Saving replaces that change with this list; discarding shows it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "編集を始めた後に、別の場所でも変更されています。保存するとその変更をこの一覧で上書きし、変更を破棄するとその内容が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你开始修改之后，别处也改过这些开关。保存会用这张列表覆盖那次修改；放弃修改则会显示那次的结果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你開始修改之後，別處也改過這些開關。儲存會用這份清單覆蓋那次修改；放棄修改則會顯示那次的結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are an administrator already." : {
