    "When somebody plays music in this call, it shows up here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When somebody plays music in this call, it shows up here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この通話で誰かが音楽を流すと、ここに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人在这次通话里放音乐时,会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人在這次通話裡放音樂時,會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When somebody signed in starts a video, it shows up here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When somebody signed in starts a video, it shows up here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サインインした人が動画を始めると、ここに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有登录账号的人开始放视频后,会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有登入帳號的人開始播放影片後,會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When there is nothing to see, leaving Tomoshibi can keep the call in a small bubble at the edge of the screen instead of the large picture-in-picture window. Android asks you to allow this once: on the next screen, choose Tomoshibi and allow it. Without it, the large window stays." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When there is nothing to see, leaving Tomoshibi can keep the call in a small bubble at the edge of the screen instead of the large picture-in-picture window. Android asks you to allow this once: on the next screen, choose Tomoshibi and allow it. Without it, the large window stays."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "映像がないとき、Tomoshibi を離れると、大きなピクチャ・イン・ピクチャのウインドウの代わりに、画面の端の小さなバブルで通話を続けられます。Android では一度だけ許可が必要です。次の画面で Tomoshibi を選んで許可してください。許可しない場合は大きなウインドウのままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有画面的时候，离开 Tomoshibi 后通话可以缩成屏幕边上的一个小浮窗，不用系统那个大画中画窗口。Android 需要你允许一次：在接下来的页面里选 Tomoshibi，然后允许。不允许的话，还是用大窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有畫面的時候，離開 Tomoshibi 後通話可以縮成螢幕邊上的一個小浮窗，不用系統那個大的子母畫面視窗。Android 需要你允許一次：在接下來的頁面裡選 Tomoshibi，然後允許。不允許的話，還是用大視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you join" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
